{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はミュージックステーションでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は今回で3回目です！\nとても嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リハーサルも本番も\n3回目だけどあの階段を降りるのも\n生放送も緊張してしまいます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、心臓をどんどんって\n自分で押すの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって、他の出演者の方の前で\nいつものライブ前みたいに\n背中をバシッと叩いてもらうことは\nできないから！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/05/0345324/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/05/0345324/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MステのMをつくってると見せかけて\nみさ先輩にいたずら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/05/0345324/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたは撮影です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また話せるようになったら話すね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんにお知らせしたいことも\nもうそろそろ話せるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うふふふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たのしみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/05/0345324/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の空き時間は\nみなみちゃんとひめちゃんと\nカフェに行ったんだよ～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい距離のいい関係性で\n居心地がいいし\n私は2人を守りたくなる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"別になにがあったわけでもないけど、\nなんかくすぐられる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし！任せておけ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人だけ二期生なんだけどね( ˘ｰωｰ˘ )！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、大人になってもこの関係を\n続けたいって思う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/05/0345324/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/05/0345324/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/05/0345324/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、おやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}